  "description": "Log-centric dashboard for the podcast app containers in VictoriaLogs (instance=prod-podcast, app=podcast; `surface` is api, pipeline or web). Pick a surface with the selector. The error-pattern panels run a case-insensitive regex over the lines, so keep the time range to a day or so (a 7-day range takes ~20 s of the 30 s query limit). The provider-failure panels match UNAVAILABLE / high demand / provider_retry / `All N attempts failed`; the bare `503` of the Loki version was dropped because it matched the millisecond field of every timestamp (',503').",
